    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/3cfb5577a4734b62e8ecdbf497de3229.webp?t=1753524042\" width=167 height=35 /></span>\u00a0a minimalistic\u00a0<strong>FPS movement\u00a0shooter.\u00a0</strong>An energy drink-sized time capsule of endless fighting. A micro-world of bots in a perpetual state of meaningless conversation with each other. Stay as long as you like - they've fought long before you, and they'll fight long after you're gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/bdc4a22b0e2934c313872e56fd687ab7.webp?t=1753524042\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.poster.avif?t=1753524042\" width=690 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.webm?t=1753524042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.mp4?t=1753524042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a simple and responsive player moveset, featuring sliding, jumping, and a double-jump that allows you to redirect your velocity. Kill enemies with your sword and gun and find unique interactions hidden in these mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/f0bcbb68ebe5def9dcf4d45ed5d3a37b.webp?t=1753524042\" width=600 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/fad1beed7c8ae58a63a740e83345b4f6.poster.avif?t=1753524042\" width=690 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/fad1beed7c8ae58a63a740e83345b4f6.webm?t=1753524042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/fad1beed7c8ae58a63a740e83345b4f6.mp4?t=1753524042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> You are a rare visitor in this world. Go deep into chasing high-scores and watch as enemies begin to target you, escalating the gameplay into chaos. Alternatively, sit back and observe the bots stuck in the endless cycle of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/87558854be1c20e7e56de542d6f608d7.webp?t=1753524042\" width=600 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/a5d956cc5775c0eeaa9b83dae2576a17.poster.avif?t=1753524042\" width=688 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/a5d956cc5775c0eeaa9b83dae2576a17.webm?t=1753524042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/a5d956cc5775c0eeaa9b83dae2576a17.mp4?t=1753524042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk around the lobby and explore the world that houses none. Take it all in as the world hangs in a standstill, near entropy but never quite there... </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/3cfb5577a4734b62e8ecdbf497de3229.webp?t=1753524042\" width=167 height=35 /></span>\u00a0a minimalistic\u00a0<strong>FPS movement\u00a0shooter.\u00a0</strong>An energy drink-sized time capsule of endless fighting. A micro-world of bots in a perpetual state of meaningless conversation with each other. Stay as long as you like - they've fought long before you, and they'll fight long after you're gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/bdc4a22b0e2934c313872e56fd687ab7.webp?t=1753524042\" width=600 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.poster.avif?t=1753524042\" width=690 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.webm?t=1753524042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/938c10e29c695571c3f83faa8d3b8181.mp4?t=1753524042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a simple and responsive player moveset, featuring sliding, jumping, and a double-jump that allows you to redirect your velocity. Kill enemies with your sword and gun and find unique interactions hidden in these mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/f0bcbb68ebe5def9dcf4d45ed5d3